 s                    | acl_life_r | SELECT
 s__as_of             | PUBLIC     | EXECUTE
 s__between           | PUBLIC     | EXECUTE
 s__between_symmetric | PUBLIC     | EXECUTE
 s__from_to           | PUBLIC     | EXECUTE
